ition was followed by Street Fighter II' Turbo: Hyper Fighting, released several months later.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/street-fighter-ii-champion-edition", "collections": [{"id": 2879, "name": "Street Fighter II"}, {"id": 219, "name": "Street Fighter"}]}